"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 40 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, more often than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 154% of normal for June to July, then fell to 51% for October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 41% on the middle. On grid 20613 the driest year was 1965 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
